Name: "Sample: morph targets"
Scope: Session
Description: Demonstrates how to deform a model with morph targets
FullDescription: |
   This sample demonstrates how to drive the morph targets (blend shapes) of a model from a script and from an animation, combined with skeletal animation, on models imported from glTF and FBX files.
